*.godot/
.godot/
verify/headless-test.log

# Third-party art/audio binaries are NOT in this public repo: their licences
# allow use in the game but forbid redistributing the raw files (ArtManOil,
# Sova Digital, reodesuxz, Sonniss). They live only in the local assets/
# folder and are baked into the web export. The manifests (assets/ASSETS.md,
# assets/audio/AUDIO.md) ARE tracked: re-download the packs from the sources
# listed there to rebuild locally with real assets. Without them the game
# falls back to procedural art/audio.
assets/**/*.png
assets/**/*.wav
assets/**/*.ttf
assets/**/*.txt
